<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia steady at 1.8600 per dlr in Kiev.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia steady at 1.8600 per dlr in Kiev.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia was unchanged at 1.8600 per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange on Monday.</p>
<p>					  June 2	     May 30</p>
<p> Hryvnia rate to dollar		1.8600	     1.8600</p>
<p> Volume traded			$2.14 mln	  $4.17 mln</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom +380-44-244-9150</p>
